{"title":"Platinum Series","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"revolt-smart-watch","title":"Revoltt Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into luxury with Revoltt Smart Watch: Sleek Stainless Steel, Durable Metallic Body, \u0026amp; Advanced Health Suite. Premium tech for your elite lifestyle!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eRevolt Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolt Smartwatch is designed for those who demand cutting-edge technology and sleek design in their wearable devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis your ultimate tool for staying connected, tracking your health, and boosting your daily productivity. Whether you're in a meeting, at the gym, or out with friends, the Revolt Smartwatch fits effortlessly into your routine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Revolt Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolt Smartwatch comes with a robust set of features to keep you ahead. Track your fitness with precision using its advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, texts, and apps, all visible on a clear, high-resolution display. The long-lasting battery ensures you’re always ready for action, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily match your watch to your outfit and mood.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Revolt Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 400 x 400 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Revolt SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Luna Smartwatch means embracing a device that enhances your life with its high-end features and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and customizable appearance make it a standout choice in the smartwatch market. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gun Metal","offer_id":46539391664406,"sku":"19819","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":46539391631638,"sku":"19820","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold","offer_id":46539391598870,"sku":"19818","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48949103558934,"sku":"22463","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/RevoltGolden01.webp?v=1736870078"},{"product_id":"vogue-smartwatch","title":"Vogue Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eVogue Smart Watch Description!\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vogue Smartwatch from ZeroLifestyle is a perfect blend of style, functionality, and durability. Designed for fitness enthusiasts and busy professionals alike, this smartwatch offers a plethora of features to keep you connected and on top of your health goals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Vogue Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vogue \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003ecomes with a vivid full-color touch display that remains clear even under bright sunlight.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts comfortable, lightweight strap ensures it can be worn all day. Key features include continuous heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and tracking for various activities like walking, running, and cycling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt also includes a step counter and calorie tracker, helping you stay on top of your fitness goals. Smart notifications allow you to receive calls, texts, and social media alerts directly on your wrist, ensuring you never miss an important message.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Vogue Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHealth Tracking: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eActivity Tracking: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnectivity: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: Multi-day battery life\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: Suitable for intense workouts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomization: Multiple watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Silver","offer_id":48892245508374,"sku":"20684","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48892245377302,"sku":"20683","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Blue","offer_id":48892245475606,"sku":"20685","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":48892245410070,"sku":"20687","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":48892245442838,"sku":"20686","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Vogue_Silver_0000.webp?v=1742632877"},{"product_id":"sigma-smartwatch","title":"Sigma Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe All New Sigma gives your lifestyle a new dimension in Smartwatches with a 2.01” IPS Curved HD Display paired with a Textured Silicon Strap and a fully functioning Rotating Crown enabled with Smart Notifications, Smart Workout Modes, Health Suite and 100+ Smartwatch Faces, AI Assistant and a 5 Day Battery Life Without Charge to level up your daily activities!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Sigma:\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Sigma is embossed with a 2.01” IPS Curved HD Display\u003cbr\u003eFully Rotating Crown \u003cbr\u003eA Textured Silicon Strap with complete health tracking, workout modes and smart notifications for BT Calling, Text Messaging and AI Voice Assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Sigma:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, Multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Orange Titanium","offer_id":48864495763734,"sku":"20562","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","offer_id":48864495665430,"sku":"20561","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Starlight Black","offer_id":48864495730966,"sku":null,"price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Starlight Titanium","offer_id":48864495796502,"sku":"20563","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Black","offer_id":48864495698198,"sku":"20564","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/2_d3c6b345-499c-4556-803e-4c31aef81269.webp?v=1760354528"},{"product_id":"elite-smart-watch","title":"Elite Smartwatch","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"pin-spacer\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite smartwatch is a testament to innovation and style. Boasting a stunning 2.04\" AMOLED display, it delivers a visual experience like no other.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eElite Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eZero Smartwatch\u003c\/a\u003e combines high-tech features with a stylish design. Perfect for those who want both performance and elegance, this smartwatch helps you stay connected, track your health, and improve your daily routine. Whether you're at work, the gym, or out with friends, the Elite Smartwatch fits effortlessly into your life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Elite Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite Smartwatch comes with a robust set of features to keep you ahead. Track your fitness with precision using its advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multiple sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, texts, and apps, all visible on a clear, high-resolution display. The long-lasting battery ensures you’re always ready for action, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily match your watch to your outfit and mood.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Elite Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 400 x 400 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Elite SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite Smartwatch stands out with its powerful features and stylish design, making it the perfect choice for anyone looking to enhance their lifestyle. Its extensive health tracking, smart connectivity, and customizable design set it apart in the smartwatch market. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight","offer_id":48944557818134,"sku":"20610","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":48944557785366,"sku":"20611","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48944557850902,"sku":"20609","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Black_1.webp?v=1725950686"},{"product_id":"revoltt-pro-smartwatch","title":"Revoltt Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eRevolttt Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe revolttt Pro is a cutting-edge smartwatch designed to seamlessly blend health, connectivity, and style. Featuring a sleek AMOLED display, it provides crystal-clear visuals and exceptional battery life, allowing you to stay connected for up to 5 days with a single charge. Whether you're tracking your heart rate, monitoring your sleep, or controlling your music, the revoltt Pro brings modern tech to your wrist with a sporty design that suits every lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Revolttt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolttt Pro combines performance and style with an AMOLED display (1.43 inches, 466x466 resolution) for vibrant visuals and easy navigation across 8 menu styles. Equipped with Bluetooth 5.3, it offers seamless connectivity for calls, messaging alerts, and synchronization with your phone’s contact list.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003efeatures multiple health monitoring functions, including heart rate, blood pressure, SP02, sleep monitoring, and more, ensuring you stay on top of your health at all times. The built-in Google and Siri Voice Assistants offer added convenience, while the diverse sports modes and the ability to control music directly from the watch make it perfect for both fitness and entertainment enthusiasts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a water resistance rating of IP67, a durable metal and plastic body, and a stainless steel strap, the Revoltt Pro is both stylish and functional. Plus, with up to 5 days of battery life, you can keep up with your busy schedule without constant recharging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Revoltt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 1.43 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: AMOLED\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResolution: 466 x 466\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Calling Chip: Single chip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransmission Range: 10 meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynchronize Contact Book\/Calls: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncoming Call\/Messaging Alert: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate: HX3605\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePedometer: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSP02 Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOxygen Monitor: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking (female): Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathing Training: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharge Time: 150 minutes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorking Time: 5 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: 480 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Type: 671927\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Method: 2-pins magnet cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePhysical Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 55.00*49.00*14.00 mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBody Material: Metal + Plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrap Material: Stainless Steel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 66g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP67\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 100+ Cloud, 5+1 Built-in, Animated Support\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 5 Cloud, 107 Built-in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanguages: 12+ (including English, Spanish, French, Arabic, etc.)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGames: 4 (Flappy Bird, 2048, Whack-A-Mole, Thunder Fighter)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Assistants: Google, Siri\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Control: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeather Updates: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOther Features: Alarm, Flash Light, Calculator, DND Mode, Pedometer, Sedentary Reminder, Water Reminder\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Revoltt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revoltt Pro is your ultimate wrist companion for fitness, productivity, and entertainment. Its stylish, durable design, along with robust health tracking capabilities and seamless connectivity, makes it the ideal choice for those who demand the best in wearable tech. Whether you're at the gym, in a meeting, or on the go, the Revoltt Pro keeps you connected, healthy, and in control.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gun Metal","offer_id":49534031266070,"sku":"22409","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":49534031200534,"sku":"22411","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Champagne Gold","offer_id":49534031167766,"sku":"22407","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":49534031233302,"sku":"22805","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/02_14d4c7f7-c21c-49be-8519-5f340b58ebd5.webp?v=1734007033"},{"product_id":"regal-smartwatch","title":"Regal AI Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Regal Smartwatch is an elegant fusion of style and innovation. Its sleek, modern design and durable construction make it a versatile accessory for any occasion, whether you're at work, out casually, or hitting the gym.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sleek, modern finish with sturdy construction.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid AMOLED Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch screen with customizable menu views.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use and up to 25–30 days on standby. Quick 2-hour charging.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e107 Sports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tracks performance across various activities including running, cycling, and yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStay Connected:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handle calls, messages, and notifications from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Compatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e Interact with Google Assistant or Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-In Entertainment:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes 4 fun games like Flappy Bird and 2048.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEveryday Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, and calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch AMOLED screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, blood pressure tracker, SpO2 level measurement, sleep tracking, stress management, menstrual cycle tracking.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 107 modes including running, cycling, yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Calls, messages, notifications, music playback, call records, find phone.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Google Assistant, Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGames:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4 built-in games.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Regal Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Regal \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis the perfect blend of sophistication and smart innovation. With its stylish design, comprehensive health tracking features, and a suite of practical and entertainment tools, it seamlessly fits into your daily life. Whether you're focused on fitness, staying organized, or just having some fun, the Regal Smartwatch is your ideal companion, ready to step into the future with you!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Copper Silver","offer_id":50270222516502,"sku":"22552","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Obsidian Gold","offer_id":50372312826134,"sku":"22554","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":49685919531286,"sku":"22550","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Aqua Silver","offer_id":49685919465750,"sku":"22556","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Emerald Silver","offer_id":49685919432982,"sku":"22558","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Racing Red Silver","offer_id":49685919498518,"sku":"22548","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/CopperSilver_1.webp?v=1756127463"},{"product_id":"jewel-smartwatch","title":"Jewel Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eJewel Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eStylish and Durable Design\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExquisitely engineered with a robust Zinc alloy shell combined with PC and ABS elements. Available in two variants—Jewel (with a lightweight profile of 30g\/44g strap options) and Jewel SE (83g with a premium steel band)—this smartwatch is built to complement your style without weighing you down.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVivid AMOLED Display\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy a 1.1-inch AMOLED screen with a crisp 360×360 resolution that delivers vibrant visuals and excellent clarity for day-to-day interactions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePowered by a polymer battery (230mAh), the Jewel \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eoffers 5–7 days of active use alongside up to 20 days on standby. A swift charge in just 2 hours gets you back on track without missing a beat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEffortlessly manage calls, notifications, and alerts directly from your wrist. With seamless contact synchronization, call records, and split-screen functionalities, the Jewel Smartwatch ensures you never miss an important moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomize your experience using over 300 cloud-based watch faces—with 5 built-in options and DIY support—and choose from 110+ sports modes (8 built-in). Additional smart tools include voice assistant support through Google Assistant and Siri, camera control for capturing life’s moments, weather updates, alarms, calculator, LCD brightness adjustments, theater\/DND mode, motion gesture activation, and essential reminders for sedentary behavior and hydration.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay: 1.1-inch AMOLED screen with 360×360 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: 5–7 days of active use, 20 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating for dependable durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperating System: Compatible with Android 5.0+ and iOS 10+ (supporting Bluetooth 4.0).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: BLE 5.0 with a 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jewel Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Jewel Smartwatch offers an extraordinary blend of aesthetics, functionality, and smart connectivity. Whether you choose the classic Jewel or the premium Jewel SE, its refined design, comprehensive health tracking, and plethora of everyday tools ensure that you remain connected and in control—no matter if you’re working out, working hard, or winding down at the end of the day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Golden Milannese","offer_id":49924661870870,"sku":"22900","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Metal","offer_id":49924662001942,"sku":"22902","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":49924662034710,"sku":"22910","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Leather","offer_id":49924661936406,"sku":"22906","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White Leather","offer_id":49924661903638,"sku":"22904","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Milannese","offer_id":49924662067478,"sku":"22908","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Milannese","offer_id":49924661838102,"sku":"22896","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":49924661969174,"sku":"22898","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Jewel_1_57b8f293-03c2-46be-9f76-79cf4af38c09.webp?v=1773449006"},{"product_id":"legacy-smartwatch","title":"Legacy Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"119\"\u003eLegacy Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"140\"\u003eThe Legacy Smartwatch combines modern utility with timeless design, engineered to elevate your everyday life. From powerful health tracking features to customizable aesthetics, this smartwatch is built for users who demand performance, comfort, and a touch of class — whether at work, in the gym, or on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"460\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"487\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"487\"\u003eRefined \u0026amp; Robust Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: 44mm zinc alloy + plastic case, 56g weight with IP67 water resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"587\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"589\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"589\"\u003eVibrant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e: Sharp visuals on a 1.39\" screen with brightness adjustment and always-on support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"699\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"701\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"701\"\u003eLong Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days standby with a quick 2-hour charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"801\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"803\"\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"844\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"870\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"872\"\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"902\"\u003eSpO2 Level Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"928\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"930\"\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"949\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"951\"\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"982\"\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1006\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1008\"\u003eCalorie Tracker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1026\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e120+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: Covers activities from running and cycling to yoga and beyond.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1114\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e: Stay updated with call alerts, messages, reminders, and app notifications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1216\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1249\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003eVoice Assistant Integration\u003c\/strong\u003e: Compatible with voice assistants for hands-free commands.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1309\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1338\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003eInteractive Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13 dynamic faces, including 6 animated and full DIY customization.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1407\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003eEntertainment on Wrist\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in game (\"Plane\") for quick play.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1479\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1501\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003eDaily Essentials\u003c\/strong\u003e: Alarm, weather, flashlight, calculator, sedentary reminder, drink water prompt, camera control, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1644\" data-start=\"1615\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1659\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: AMOLED, 1.39-inch, brightness adjustable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003eBattery\u003c\/strong\u003e: 400mAh lithium battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1742\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1758\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003eUsage Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days regular, 25–30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003eCharging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 2 hours via magnetic suction\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1846\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate (HRS3605), SpO2, Blood pressure, Accelerometer (LIS2DOCTR)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1933\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1951\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003eSports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: 120+ activities supported\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1981\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1999\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.2, 20m range, supports calls, contacts, call records\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2068\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2089\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e: Google Assistant, Siri compatible\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2127\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2138\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003eGames\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2153\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2170\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003eOther Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e: Flashlight, alarm, weather, calculator, camera control, DND mode, motion gesture activation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2266\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2288\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e: IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2340\" data-start=\"2303\"\u003eWhy Choose the Legacy Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2688\" data-start=\"2342\"\u003eThe Legacy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis more than just a wearable — it’s a lifestyle upgrade. Designed with precision, equipped with cutting-edge features, and built to last, it’s the perfect companion for health tracking, productivity, and staying connected. Whether you're chasing goals or winding down, Legacy adapts to your day — strong, smart, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":50200306778390,"sku":"20778","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50200306745622,"sku":"20779","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Blue","offer_id":50200306811158,"sku":"22173","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/GoldBlack_2.webp?v=1765658265"},{"product_id":"lunar-360-smartwatch","title":"Lunar 360 Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eLunar 360 Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLunar 360 Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek modern design, giving you the ultimate balance of style, performance, and wellness. With its high-resolution AMOLED display, extended battery life, and advanced health monitoring, Lunar 360 is built to keep up with your lifestyle—day and night.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⌚ \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Zinc alloy electroplated middle frame, stainless steel dual buttons, and ABS+PC bottom shell with leather-TPU strap.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong\u003eBrilliant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – 1.43-inch AMOLED round screen with 466×466 resolution and full-screen touch functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – 300 mAh polymer lithium battery offering:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 days of typical use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3 days in AOD (Always-On Display) mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eMagnetic Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient magnetic charging method for quick and reliable power-ups.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with call support, music control, notifications, and remote camera functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e❤️ \u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (VC30F-S Sensor)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSleep Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Multiple sport profiles supported, including running, cycling, walking, and more, with motion tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – AMOLED display supports vibrant pre-installed dials and downloadable options via companion app.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Tools \u0026amp; Assistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Voice assistant, weather, calendar, alarm, stopwatch, timer, calculator, world clock, sedentary \u0026amp; drink reminders.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – IP67 water resistance ensures safety in daily use and light water exposure.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy middle frame, stainless steel buttons, ABS+PC bottom shell, leather+TPU strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.43-inch AMOLED, 466×466 resolution, full-touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e RTL8773EWE-VP\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e SRAM 560 KB, PSRAM 4 MB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlash:\u003c\/strong\u003e 128 Mbit\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensors:\u003c\/strong\u003e VC30F-S heart rate \u0026amp; SpO₂ sensor, STK8321 G-sensor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 300 mAh polymer lithium (10 days use, 30 days standby, 3 days AOD mode)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Magnetic charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 (with call support, notifications, music, and more)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 65 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 53.2 × 46.5 × 12.8 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtras:\u003c\/strong\u003e Voice assistant, remote camera, breathing exercises, business card holder, OTA software updates\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eWhy Choose Lunar 360 Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Lunar 360 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch\u003c\/a\u003e is more than just a wearable—it’s a complete lifestyle companion. Whether you want to stay on top of your health, boost your productivity, or enjoy seamless connectivity, Lunar 360 delivers it all in a stylish, durable package. With its AMOLED display, customizable watch faces, long battery life, and IP67 water resistance, it’s built for those who demand performance, sophistication, and reliability every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Brown Leather","offer_id":50407371014422,"sku":"23159","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold Silicone","offer_id":50407370850582,"sku":"23162","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Silicone","offer_id":50407370981654,"sku":"23161","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Leather","offer_id":50407370948886,"sku":"23157","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Leather","offer_id":50407371079958,"sku":"23160","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey Silver Silicone","offer_id":50407371047190,"sku":"23164","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Silicone","offer_id":50407371112726,"sku":"23165","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Silicone","offer_id":50407370916118,"sku":"23163","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Leather","offer_id":50407370883350,"sku":"23158","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/lunar_Brown-Leather_1.webp?v=1756987036"},{"product_id":"visionary-smartwatch","title":"Visionary Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contains\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1 × ZERO Visionary Smartwatch\u003cbr\u003e1 × User Manual\u003cbr\u003e1 × Warranty Card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZERO Visionary Smartwatch\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe ZERO Visionary Smartwatch combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek modern design, giving you the ultimate balance of style, performance, and wellness. With its high-resolution AMOLED display, extended battery life, and advanced health monitoring, Visionary is built to keep up with your lifestyle day and night.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBrilliant AMOLED Display:\u003cbr\u003e1.85-inch AMOLED HD full-touch screen with stunning clarity and vibrant visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeamless Bluetooth Calling*  Single-chip Bluetooth 5.3 delivers stable, clear call quality directly from your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*Customizable Watch Faces* Switch between built-in dials or cloud-based designs to suit your mood and style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e *Comprehensive Health Tracking*  Real-time heart rate monitoring, SpO₂ tracking, sleep analysis, and female health tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e *Fitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes* Multiple workout profiles supported for accurate performance and activity tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Notifications \u0026amp; Controls \u003c\/strong\u003eStay updated with instant alerts and manage music, camera, and weather with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP68 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e  Designed to handle sweat, rain, and splashes for worry-free daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to 15 days of typical use on a single charge for uninterrupted performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.85-inch AMOLED HD, full-touch screen\u003cbr\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.3 (with call support, notifications, music, and camera control)\u003cbr\u003eHealth Sensors: Heart rate, SpO₂, sleep tracking, female health monitoring\u003cbr\u003eSports: Multiple sport modes with motion tracking\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance: IP68\u003cbr\u003eBattery Life: Up to 15 days\u003cbr\u003eCharging: Magnetic charging cable\u003cbr\u003eBuild: Stylish, durable design with premium finish\u003cbr\u003eWarranty: 365 Days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Choose ZERO Visionary?\u003cbr\u003eThe ZERO Visionary \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch in Pakistan\u003c\/a\u003e is more than just a wearable it’s your complete lifestyle companion. Whether you want to track your health, boost productivity, or enjoy seamless connectivity, Visionary delivers it all in a stylish, durable package. With its AMOLED display, customizable watch faces, long battery life, and IP68 water resistance, it’s designed for those who demand performance, sophistication, and reliability every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight Silicone","offer_id":50583080632598,"sku":"22948","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Silicone","offer_id":50583080435990,"sku":"22947","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Brown Silicone","offer_id":50583080501526,"sku":"22949","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rainbow","offer_id":50583080599830,"sku":"22950","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Olive Green Silicone","offer_id":50583080534294,"sku":"22946","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Leather","offer_id":50583080468758,"sku":"22951","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Orange Silicone","offer_id":50583080567062,"sku":"22952","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Visionary_Starlight-Silicone_1_a7706397-974f-479a-9934-13ea5327f478.webp?v=1774870143"},{"product_id":"navigator-smartwatch","title":"Navigator Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"351\"\u003eNavigator Smartwatch – Precision GPS. Rugged Performance.\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"704\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eNavigator \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch\u003c\/a\u003e is built for people who take accuracy seriously — from outdoor explorers to everyday athletes. With \u003cstrong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"504\"\u003ehigh-precision GPS\u003c\/strong\u003e, advanced health sensors, and a \u003cstrong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"563\"\u003eworking rotating crown\u003c\/strong\u003e for ultra-smooth control, Navigator gives you powerful performance in a tough, outdoor-ready design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"704\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eSpec - Navigator\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"709\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"748\"\u003e🔭 High-Precision GPS Tracking\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"889\"\u003eGo further with confidence. Navigator’s \u003cstrong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"827\"\u003eintegrated high-precision GPS chip\u003c\/strong\u003e tracks your route, pace, and distance with accuracy across:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"976\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"901\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"901\"\u003eWalking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"913\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"913\"\u003eRunning\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"925\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"925\"\u003eCycling\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"943\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"943\"\u003eTrail running\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"976\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eHiking \/ on-foot exploration\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1016\"\u003eNo phone needed for location tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1021\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1070\"\u003e🎛 Working Rotating Crown + Sport Button\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1104\"\u003eNavigate your watch like a pro:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1125\"\u003eRotating crown\u003c\/strong\u003e to scroll menus, switch tiles, and zoom quickly\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1247\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1209\"\u003eDedicated Sport Mode button\u003c\/strong\u003e for one-tap access to your workouts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003eExtra \u003cstrong data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1271\"\u003eHome button\u003c\/strong\u003e for fast control in any situation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1400\"\u003eEven with gloves or sweaty hands, the physical controls keep everything under your command.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1405\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1454\"\u003e🌈 290+ Watch Faces \u0026amp; Full Customisation\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1477\"\u003eMake it truly yours:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1520\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1520\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003e5 default watch faces on the watch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1559\"\u003eOver 290+ additional watch faces\u003c\/strong\u003e available in the app\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003eDIY custom dials using your own photos, colours, and styles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003eYou can switch looks from sporty to formal in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1707\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1755\"\u003e⚡ Magnetic Charging \u0026amp; Long Battery Life\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1820\"\u003eCharging is effortless with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1817\"\u003eincluded magnetic charger\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1882\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1882\"\u003eSimply snap the charger to the back – no ports, no hassle\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1903\"\u003e300mAh battery\u003c\/strong\u003e with up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1942\"\u003e3–5 days of typical use\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1980\"\u003eUp to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1978\"\u003e10–12 days on standby\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003eFull charge in about \u003cstrong data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e2.5–3 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2024\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2070\"\u003e🧠 Advanced Health \u0026amp; Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2123\"\u003eStay on top of your health with precision sensors:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2154\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2154\"\u003e24\/7 heart rate monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2187\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2187\"\u003eBlood oxygen (SpO2) tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2226\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2226\"\u003eBlood pressure \u0026amp; stress monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2259\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2259\"\u003eSleep tracking with insights\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2307\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2307\"\u003eBreath training modes (Relax \/ Fall asleep)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e100+ sports modes with detailed metrics (steps, kcal, duration, MET)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2383\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2427\"\u003e🖥 1.43\" AMOLED Display + Always-On\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2502\"\u003eEnjoy a vivid, sharp view with a \u003cstrong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2499\"\u003e1.43-inch AMOLED display (466×466)\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2535\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2535\"\u003eAlways-On Display clock mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003eFull touch control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003eCrisp, bright visuals indoors and outdoors\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2608\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2658\"\u003e📞 Smart Features That Keep You Connected\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2714\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2714\"\u003eBluetooth calling (dial\/answer\/reject on the watch)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2768\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2768\"\u003eApp notifications (social apps, SMS, calls, etc.)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003eAI voice assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2843\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2843\"\u003eWeather, alarms, timers, stopwatch, world clock\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2906\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2906\"\u003eSedentary \/ drink water reminders, goal achievement alerts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003eRemote camera shutter \u0026amp; music control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003eFind my phone, DND \u0026amp; low power mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"2993\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3016\"\u003e💧 Built Tough\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3086\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3086\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3038\"\u003eIP68 waterproof\u003c\/strong\u003e – ready for sweat, splashes, and everyday use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3137\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3137\"\u003eAluminum alloy + ABS frame, PC base, TPU strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003eComfortable 60.5g wearable weight\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Red","offer_id":50750584226070,"sku":"23043","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green","offer_id":50750584291606,"sku":"23046","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Gray","offer_id":50750584258838,"sku":"23047","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Orange","offer_id":50750584324374,"sku":"23044","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50750584160534,"sku":"23048","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50750584193302,"sku":"23045","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_d8b06a71-8b9c-4564-8344-11b83b4ca7b3.webp?v=1766048642"},{"product_id":"jewel-pro","title":"Jewel Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003eJewel Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with a premium alloy body and a comfortable 18mm strap, the Jewel Pro carries a sleek 38.9mm dial while staying impressively light at just 29g. Built to handle daily life, it carries an IP68 water resistance rating so it keeps up with you through sweat, splashes, and rain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVivid AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy a larger 1.19-inch AMOLED screen with a sharp 390×390 resolution that delivers vibrant colors, deep contrast, and excellent clarity. With customizable menu view styles and an always-on display option, every glance feels premium.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by a 170mAh polymer battery, the Jewel Pro offers around 3 days of active use and up to 20 days on standby. Convenient magnetic wire charging tops it up fully in just 2 hours, getting you back on the move without delay.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Calling \u0026amp; NFC\u003c\/strong\u003e Take and make calls directly from your wrist thanks to the built-in speaker and Bluetooth calling chip. The integrated NFC support adds an extra layer of everyday convenience, keeping essential functions right at your fingertips.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/strong\u003e Effortlessly manage calls, notifications, and alerts straight from your wrist. With contact synchronization, call records, incoming call and message alerts, split-screen functionality, and find-device\/find-phone tools, the Jewel Pro ensures you never miss an important moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your experience with 91+ cloud-based watch faces (around 6 built-in), animated watch faces, and DIY watch face support — and choose from 120+ sports modes (15–20 built-in). Additional smart tools include Siri voice assistant support, music playback and control through the watch speaker, camera control, weather updates, alarms, flashlight, calculator, LCD brightness adjustment, theater\/DND mode, motion gesture wake, theme modes, stopwatch\/countdown, the built-in 2048 game, OTA firmware upgrades, and helpful reminders for sedentary behavior, hydration, and low battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch AMOLED screen with 390×390 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 170mAh polymer battery — around 3 days active use, 20 days standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours (magnetic wire charging).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for dependable durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 6.0+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e BT3.0 \/ BLE 5.4 with a 25-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e NFC support and Bluetooth calling.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e 128M.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLanguages:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13 supported languages.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jewel Pro Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Jewel Pro Smartwatch brings together refined design, a brilliant AMOLED display, and genuinely useful smart connectivity. With Bluetooth calling, NFC, comprehensive health tracking, and a deep set of everyday tools, it keeps you connected and in control — whether you're working out, powering through your day, or winding down at night.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Silver Gold Ring","offer_id":51268424925462,"sku":"24567","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple Ring","offer_id":51268424958230,"sku":"24571","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Ring","offer_id":51268424892694,"sku":"24569","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ANGLE_01.webp?v=1782288247"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/collections\/desktop_copy_1.webp?v=1764246056","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/collections\/platinum-series-products.oembed","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}